{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師注曰：二不成雙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師注曰：一不成隻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師注曰：好與劈脊便棒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孤峰長夏命闍\n黎論法華助顯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是日聽眾雲湧，參請者不得前。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節後委諸頭首次第分座，故云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雪西堂二十年侍師，始得記。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前一日迅風特異。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南臺孝姪補住白雲\n江頭，別去瓣香寄供，期正三日為上堂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "官禁不容潑屎潑尿。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "睡來還合眼麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡僧還喫飯麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竟不向上道與\n他。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伏聞鈍置人者，遭人\n鈍置。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嘗言達磨大師缺當門齒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孝敏先生捐館日，觸目傷懷，槌床而逝。時和尚舟阻武康鮑庄，嘔吐一日夜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大師狀西堂受業師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師自此說法廢白椎。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0945_p0106c28"}
